    "detailed_description": "Cursed House 6 - a game in the Match 3 Puzzle genre. The increasing difficulty of the game forced us to create two sets of levels: one for regular players and one for hardcore players.<br />\r\nTwo new mechanics have been introduced:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDamned Coins - coins that cannot be collected; collecting any coin results in a loss.<br />\r\nCrest<br />\r\nThe player can choose the difficulty level in the settings. If the player does not choose anything, the difficulty level is determined automatically based on how the player plays.<br />\r\nThis game already includes elements of interactive help, which will be further developed in future games.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n4 Hidden Object scenes<br />\r\n8 Spot the Difference scenes<br />\r\n100 Match 3 levels (actually, there are many more levels as some levels come in two variations: easy and hard)<br />\r\n20 Solitaire games<br />\r\na town to cleanse froom the evil spirits",
